        "original_id": "3123cc39-fdce-5e49-a711-f1408fdb3258",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Toyota Innova, Toyota Hilux, Toyota Fortuner\n- Companies: Toyota\n- Projects: IMV program\n- Topics: vehicle naming\n\nFacts:\n- Toyota's IMV program includes the Toyota Innova, the Toyota Hilux pickup truck, and the Toyota Fortuner SUV.\n- The Toyota Hilux is a series of light commercial vehicles produced and marketed by Toyota.\n- The Toyota Hilux has also been stylized as HiLux and historically as Hi-Lux.\n- In 1976, Toyota retired the Hilux name in North America in favor of the names \"Truck\", \"Pickup Truck\", or \"Compact Truck\".\n- Most countries used the Hilux name for the entire life of the series.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
